## Dropzone workflow

`00. Dropzone/` is the standing drop zone. The user downloads/saves files there without
worrying about naming or destination. When asked to organize (or when working in the
drive and the dropzone is non-empty), Claude should **directly, without asking per
file**: rename each file to the `YYYY-MM-DD Description` convention and move it to the
correct subfolder, matching existing category folders. Only ask when the destination is
genuinely ambiguous. The drive root and the dropzone should end up empty of loose files.

