## Conventions

- Folders prefixed with zero-padded numbers for ordering (`00.`, `01.`…); `9X.` prefix = archived
- Dates in filenames follow `YYYY-MM-DD` format: `YYYY-MM-DD Description.ext`
- Spaces in filenames, not underscores
- When filing a document, match an existing category subfolder before creating a new one
- {{LANGUAGES_NOTE, e.g. "Filenames may mix English and <language> depending on the document"}}

## Common Tasks

- File a received invoice or document into the correct subfolder
- Find a specific document (by date, provider, or type)
- Summarize what's in a folder or check for gaps

## Other filing notes

- When filing a document that carries an expiry/renewal date (ID, insurance policy,
  vehicle inspection), also update `01. Documents/00. Expiry & Renewals Tracker.xlsx`
  (or the owner's equivalent tracker)
- Never store recovery codes, authenticator backups, or private-key files (`.p12`,
  `.pem`) loose in the drive — flag them to the user for a password manager
